WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.459
Mom had good news.

2
00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:12.165
"We're going to babysit for Martha today."

3
00:00:12.166 --> 00:00:15.353
"Yay!" said Emmy.

4
00:00:15.354 --> 00:00:20.687
"Baby Martha is so cute!"

5
00:00:20.688 --> 00:00:24.352
Soon Martha's mom brought Martha.

6
00:00:24.353 --> 00:00:29.210
She brought a diaper bag and crib too.

7
00:00:29.211 --> 00:00:34.165
"I want to play with Martha," Oliver said.

8
00:00:34.166 --> 00:00:37.538
"She is too little," Mom said.

9
00:00:37.539 --> 00:00:41.637
Then Martha started to cry.

10
00:00:41.638 --> 00:00:46.320
"What does she want?" Harry asked.

11
00:00:46.321 --> 00:00:50.352
"She wants a new diaper," said Mom.

12
00:00:50.353 --> 00:00:53.864
Mom got Martha a new diaper.

13
00:00:53.865 --> 00:00:57.229
Martha smiled.

14
00:00:57.230 --> 00:01:00.503
The kids ate lunch.

15
00:01:00.504 --> 00:01:06.924
Martha started to cry again.

16
00:01:06.925 --> 00:01:12.087
"What does she want?" Emmy asked.

17
00:01:12.088 --> 00:01:18.567
"She wants lunch," Mom said.

18
00:01:18.568 --> 00:01:33.420
Emmy gave Martha a bottle.

19
00:01:33.421 --> 00:01:36.648
Martha burped and smiled.

20
00:01:36.649 --> 00:01:40.996
Soon Martha started to cry again.

21
00:01:40.997 --> 00:01:44.874
"What does Martha want?" Harry asked.

22
00:01:44.875 --> 00:01:49.339
"She wants to play," said Oliver.

23
00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:57.415
"She wants a nap," Mom said.

24
00:01:57.416 --> 00:02:03.704
Harry put the baby in her crib.

25
00:02:03.705 --> 00:02:09.062
Martha took a long nap.

26
00:02:09.063 --> 00:02:12.692
Then Martha woke up.

27
00:02:12.693 --> 00:02:16.190
She started to cry.

28
00:02:16.191 --> 00:02:21.957
She was not wet or hungry or tired.

29
00:02:21.958 --> 00:02:25.855
But she was still crying.

30
00:02:25.856 --> 00:02:29.414
Mom didn't know what to do.

31
00:02:29.415 --> 00:02:36.703
"What does Martha want now?" she asked.

32
00:02:36.704 --> 00:02:46.192
"I know!" Oliver ran to his room.

33
00:02:46.193 --> 00:02:50.705
He got his green alligator.

34
00:02:50.706 --> 00:02:57.382
Oliver gave the alligator to Martha.

35
00:02:57.383 --> 00:03:00.491
She kicked and laughed.

36
00:03:00.492 --> 00:03:03.853
"See, Mom?" Oliver said.

37
00:03:03.854 --> 00:03:09.444
"Martha wants to play!"

